== Trivia ==
*Enderman and [[Vampire Slayer]]s are the only slayer quests exclusive to one island.
*The rank obtained upon reaching Enderman Slayer LVL 8, "Tall Purple Hater", could imply that Voidgloom Seraphs in Hypixel SkyBlock are canonically purple, rather than black as they appear in Minecraft.

